# BANNERFALL: the first three campaign battles won through the menus with the
# buttons alone, at a human pace (a press every ten frames, about six a
# second). Each battle is dealt from a fixed seed so the script can be
# replayed; the presses were planned by looking at the board and the coming
# end of turn only. Footmen hold in columns of three, bowmen keep lanes clear.
game bannerfall
wait 30
# the title: CAMPAIGN; the map starts on battle 1; its briefing; march
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 5
expect state == 3
expect level == 1
cheat battle_seed 1 1011
